  message: "2026-11-15: this item does not depend on the Agda grammar choice. Its three fixtures (stable_id_items_review_11152026/work/new/agda, agda2, agda3) give the same symbols under tree-sitter-agda 1.3.3 and under the language pack's revision (~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/naviz_agda_investigation_11152026/README.md section 2, agda/probe_out.txt). The fix is in agda.py's naming of anonymous modules. It moves stable ids, so it rides the v15 bump."  # 22fa
